  "goodToKnow": "Die Auktion is an auction; the German synonym is die Versteigerung, and versteigern means to auction off. Der Auktionator is the auctioneer, who says zum Ersten, zum Zweiten, zum Dritten (going once, going twice, sold). Police and lost-property offices hold Fundsachenversteigerungen. Online, eBay was huge in Germany, and today Kleinanzeigen (classified ads) dominate private sales. From Latin augere (to increase). Plural: die Auktionen."
